      "name": "Query Available",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Busca habitaciones que estén disponibles y limpias para venta."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT type, COUNT(*) as cantidad, price_night\nFROM hotel_rooms\nWHERE status = 'available' AND (cleaning_status = 'clean' OR cleaning_status = 'inspected')\nGROUP BY type, price_night;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgresTool",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        -32,
        1024
      ],
      "id": "d5b28220-be41-4d64-8377-855273035558",
      "name": "Query Rooms",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Busca habitaciones que estén disponibles y limpias para venta."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT b.id, b.room_id, g.full_name, b.check_in, b.status \nFROM hotel_bookings b\nJOIN hotel_guests g ON b.guest_id = g.id\nWHERE g.full_name ILIKE '%' || {{ $json.full_name }} || '%'\nAND b.status = 'confirmed';",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "{{$fromAI.guest_name}}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgresTool",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        96,
        1024
      ],
      "id": "f62f3f64-1e07-4d9e-a7ce-7ff9a3fe6395",
      "name": "Query Reservation By Name",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Busca habitaciones que estén disponibles y limpias para venta."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT * FROM hotel_rooms \nWHERE status = 'available' \n  AND room_number = '{{ $json.room_number }}'\n  AND (cleaning_status = 'clean' OR cleaning_status = 'inspected');",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": " {{$fromAI.room_number}}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgresTool",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        224,
        1024
      ],
      "id": "b7f62c1c-2742-40cc-8f69-4eafef7e9bd0",
      "name": "Query Available By Room",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Busca si una habitación específica está libre. REQUERIDO: room_number (número de habitación). NO LLAMAR a esta herramienta si el usuario no ha dicho un número de habitación."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT \n    r.room_number,\n    i.inspection_date,\n    i.observaciones,\n    i.checklist_data->'equipamiento' as fallas_equipos,\n    i.checklist_data->'bano' as fallas_bano\nFROM hotel_room_inspections i\nJOIN hotel_rooms r ON i.room_id = r.id\nWHERE \n    (i.observaciones IS NOT NULL AND i.observaciones != '')\n    AND i.inspection_date >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '15 days'\nORDER BY i.inspection_date DESC;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgresTool",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        480,
        1008
      ],
      "id": "b0fd977e-9975-4fac-86eb-299d53d4e85e",
      "name": "Get Inspection Issues",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Obtiene las observaciones, fallas y reportes de mantenimiento generados durante las inspecciones (rondines) de las habitaciones en los últimos 15 días. Úsalo cuando el usuario pida reportes de daños, cosas por reparar o resumen de calidad."
    }
